      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006907,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "正因为遇见了电姬，我才会再次想要演戏……。/n所以，这一切才得以实现。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20069070230",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 71,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 4,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2006907025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2006907,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "千寿历和伊吕波的祖母",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "因为受邀参加世界演剧联盟，所以就是优秀剧团。/n……用在剧团电姬身上，我觉得这种逻辑未免太过粗暴。",
